    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overview\n\n- This workflow is responsible for scraping the client’s website and updating the knowledge base.\n- It can be triggered by \"Get Clients\" Workflow or run manually by filling the form when needed.\n\n## How it works\n\n- The workflow receives the client details, including the client ID and website URL to scrape.\n- All existing knowledge base records for the client are first marked as deleted.\n- The website pages are then scraped using Firecrawl.\n- The scraped content is cleaned and processed.\n- Text embeddings are generated for the cleaned content.\n- The new content and embeddings are stored in Supabase as the updated knowledge base.\n- After the new data is successfully inserted, all previously marked deleted records for the client are permanently removed.\n\n## Setup\n\n- Place the Firecrawl API key in the \"Start Website Crawl\" and \"Get Crawled Data\"",
        "height": 688,
        "width": 480
      },
